 "focusIndicator": {
  "$description": "Every focusable control: 2px solid focus.ring outline with a 2px bg.canvas gap (outline-offset: 2px). The ring must reach 3:1 against canvas, surface and sunken (checked). It never reuses an accent, so focus is never confused with selection.",
